Lughnasadh documentation (hierarchical)
=======================================

This tree follows the spirit of GNU / free-software project docs:
top-level files for install and legal; doc/ for manuals and policy.

Index
-----
* ../README.md     — overview (EN/PT)
* ../INSTALL       — build and install
* ../AUTHORS       — credits
* ../NEWS          — user-visible history
* ../ChangeLog     — developer-oriented log
* ../COPYING       — free-software notice + pointer to LICENSE
* ../LICENSE       — MIT full text
* ../CONTRIBUTING  — how to help
* architecture.md  — engine modules
* freeness.md      — free-software stance (GNU philosophy alignment)
* uci.md           — UCI commands supported
* house-policy.md  — prep vs official play

Start with ../README.md, then INSTALL, then freeness.md.
